OL,16,     Gmusical journey towards Hummel's
OL,17,     GTrumpet Concerto. Exploring the
OL,18,     Gevolution of trumpet music, from
OL,19,     GItalian baroque concertos to 20th-
OL,20,     Gcentury jazz.
